# Build-time values for the STAGING Worker bundle (ag-matchhub-staging, hub-staging.propertiguru.id).
# Public values only. The Supabase URL and publishable key below MUST match packages/db/.env.staging;
# scripts/deploy-staging.mjs injects them from that file and verify-build-target checks the bundle
# against this file, so a bundle wired to production can never be deployed as staging.
